it <00:00:08.420>takes <00:00:08.740>the <00:00:09.020>oldest <00:00:09.480>topic <00:00:10.060>from <00:00:10.380>the <00:00:10.580>queue

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:13.000
and <00:00:11.480>writes <00:00:11.740>a <00:00:12.060>short <00:00:12.440>script.

