every <00:00:22.800>word.

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:27.060
Next, <00:00:24.980>an <00:00:25.320>editor <00:00:25.740>builds <00:00:26.240>the <00:00:26.560>scenes,

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.820
and <00:00:27.760>the <00:00:27.920>video <00:00:28.360>is <00:00:28.680>rendered <00:00:29.120>and <00:00:29.500>checked

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:31.240
frame <00:00:30.340>by <00:00:30.620>frame.

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:35.920
Only <00:00:32.460>a <00:00:32.780>video <00:00:33.240>that <00:00:33.620>passes <00:00:34.100>every <00:00:34.680>check <00:00:35.280>is

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.740
saved <00:00:36.580>and <00:00:37.120>scheduled.

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:39.440
By <00:00:38.920>morning,

